          <li>PDF2Go, <a href="https://www.pdf2go.com/security" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Security</a> (files automatically deleted within 24 hours).</li>
          <li>IBM, <a href="https://www.ibm.com/reports/data-breach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cost of a Data Breach Report 2025</a> (global average 4.44 million dollars; United States record 10.22 million dollars; financial sector 5.56 million dollars).</li>
          <li>Verizon, <a href="https://www.verizon.com/about/news/2025-data-breach-investigations-report" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2025 Data Breach Investigations Report</a> (third-party involvement doubled to 30 percent); FTC, <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/start-security-guide-business" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Start with Security</a> (no one can steal what you do not have).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/tools/pdf-to-images/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF to Images</a>, <a href="/pdf-toolkit/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF Toolkit</a>, <a href="/tools/pdf-splitter/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF Splitter</a>, and <a href="/tools/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">all Tools</a>.</p>
